um'\\\\'',inputs=['\\\\''gc554'\\\\'','\\\\''x_from_q01'\\\\'','\\\\''x_from_q01'\\\\''],signs=[1,1,-1],low=504.0,high=604.0)\ncheck('\\\\''G4: \"'$554B + x - x with x from q01'\"'\\\\'',case)\nfigs={f['\\\\''id'\\\\'']:f for f in x['\\\\''figures'\\\\'']}\ndef refs(f):\n    return f.get('\\\\''inputs'\\\\'',[])+[i for i in f.get('\\\\''rests_on'\\\\'',[]) if i in figs]\nfor override in ({},{'\\\\''gfy'\\\\'':(440.0,478.5)},{'\\\\''gfy'\\\\'':(400.0,400.0)},{'\\\\''gfy'\\\\'':(440.0,440.0)}):\n    print(override,{i:c._evaluate(figs,refs,override)[i] for i in ('\\\\''x_from_q01'\\\\'','\\\\''gfy28c'\\\\'')})\n'\"","aggregated_output":"59 gate items, 27 mutants and stored render reproduced\nG24x [] [('C8', 'g28hi: sum of different quantities or periods (gfyhi, gfyhi) states no relation'), ('C9', \"g28hi (high) of v22 does not change when v1's forecast gfyhi changes\")]\nG24nv [] [('C7', 'g28hi: a figure needs either a value or a complete range with low at most high')]\nG24 [] []\nG4 [] []\nG4: $554B + x - x with x from q01 [] []\n{} {'x_from_q01': (564.846, 612.786), 'gfy28c': (506.06000000000006, 601.94)}\n{'gfy': (440.0, 478.5)} {'x_from_q01': (620.4, 674.685), 'gfy28c': (499.71500000000015, 608.285)}\n{'gfy': (400.0, 400.0)} {'x_from_q01': (564.0, 564.0), 'gfy28c': (554.0, 554.0)}\n{'gfy': (440.0, 440.0)} {'x_from_q01': (620.4, 620.4), 'gfy28c': (554.0000000000001, 554.0000000000001)}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"GATE FAIL\n\n**A — Blocking.** C9 still accepts cancellation when the earlier forecast is a range. In a G4 replay, `$554B + x − x` passed both checks. The checker used opposite ends of the same range for the two occurrences of `x`, so the 10% probe changed the artificial spread. With one shared value for `x`, the result stayed $554B before and after the probe. Use the same realization of each figure wherever it appears during sensitivity testing. Add this same-period case to the gate so a separate C8 refusal cannot mask the failure. [Interval arithmetic](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/calc_check.py:115) · [C9 sensitivity](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/calc_check.py:470)\n\n**B — Non-blocking.** No relabelling findings."}}
